&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;○&amp;nbsp;Incident&amp;nbsp;4&amp;nbsp;○&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
